<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh April oil output flat at 3,560 bpd mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Kazakh April oil output flat at 3,560 bpd mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's production of crude oil and gas condensate was about flat in April at 2.13 million tonnes (3,560 barrels per day) compared to March, the State Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The committee released the following figures for energy output in its latest monthly statistical bulletin. Figures in tonnes, except crude oil in million tonnes and natural gas in billion cubic meters.</p>
<p> KAZAKH ENERGY OUTPUT	Apr 97	 Mar 97	 Jan-Apr 97</p>
<p> Crude oil			2.13	   2.14	    8.28</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	 -0.2	  +12.7	     n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	+16.1	  +12.2	   +14.7</p>
<p> Natural gas		    0.66	   0.68	    2.63</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	 -3.5	  +10.5	     n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	+17.0	  +17.0	   +17.8</p>
<p> Gasoline		     202,200	116,900	 548,400</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	+73.0	   -4.7	     n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	-15.3	  -40.0	   -33.3</p>
<p> Diesel			 251,700	207,900	 840,900</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	+21.1	  +12.1	     n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	-17.8	  -26.6	   -16.5</p>
<p> Fuel oil		     265,200	294,100     1,189,200</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	 -9.8	   +2.9	     n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	 -5.9	  -13.4	    -8.7</p>
<p>-- Almaty Newsroom +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
